    s_ph^eq (equipartition phantom)      = 0.444 (16-84 [0.389, 0.510])
    f_dust(missing) = 1 - s_ph^eq/(1-s_b)= 0.505 (16-84 [0.442, 0.560])   [falsifier < 0.85: FIRES (smooth)]
    DECISION: s_ph^eq vs SMOOTH at +4.24 sigma, vs SHARP at +5.89 sigma -> SMOOTH (phantom phase)

  A2631 (M500 = 2.83e+14):
    pie curve at this mass: s_b = 0.115; SHARP s_ph = 0.115; SMOOTH s_ph = 0.351  (branch separation 0.235)
